<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Adtran started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Adtran started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial said analyst Chandan Sarkar started coverage of Adtran Inc with short-term buy and long-term hold ratings.</p>
<p>-- Set fiscal 1996 earnings estimate at $0.99 per share and 1997 estimate at $1.33 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-1/2 to 39-1/4.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
